  "sourceTitle": "Banana Bread",
  "sourceText": "Banana Bread\nBy: Alejandro Duarte\nPublished: Wednesday, December 9, 2009 - 1:14pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 beatens eggs\n1/2 teaspoon baking powder\n1/4 teaspoon baking soda\n1/2 cup butter\n1 cup sugar\n2 cups flour\n1 1/2 cups mashed banana\n1 cup pecans\n1/4 teaspoon salt\n1 teaspoon lemon juice\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix dry ingredients together. Mix wet ingredients together. Combine all ingredients. Grease bread pan. Bake at 350 degrees for 50 minutes.\n\nComments:\nbofsviogs\n\nYour welcome everyone,\nPlease, give me some info about popular dating sites: mens, womens, teens.\nThx",
